 your voluntary and informed consent solely to provide the earned Salary advance facility. You agree and provide your consent to share your information accessed by Incash provided on or through the Incash Platform for providing the earned Salary advance facility, for the following purposes:  </li>\n<li>extending and facilitating the earned salary advance facility.  </li>\n<li>KYC verification and authentication by agencies duly authorized by Incash.  </li>\n<li>legal and regulatory purposes.  </li>\n<li>providing You an improved and a better user experience.  </li>\n<li>Further sharing of your information with any third party for purposes except as outlined above shall be subject to prior intimation and your consent.  </li>\n<li>Consent and authorization of the Employer to share Your attendance data, other details etc. to enable calculation of maximum Salary Advance Facility that You may be eligible to draw based on the number of hours/days you have worked with the Employer.  </li>\n<li>Consent to receive all communications at the mobile number provided.  </li>\n<li>Consent to using 3rd party service to verify KYC details including  phone number and bank account  </li>\n<li>Specific consent to share the Application Form, Preliminary Information, all other details and information relating to You including personal information and KYC documents etc.  </li>\n<li><p>Irrevocably authorize the Employer to deduct, at source, the amount of the Salary Advance Facility,  and the Transaction Fees and deposit the same in the Repayment Account  towards repayment to Incash.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY RIGHTS BELONGING TO INCASH</strong>  </p>\n</li>\n<li>These Terms of Use do not transfer to you any Intellectual Property Rights and other proprietary information including but not limited to copyright, trademarks, service marks, graphics and logos used in or in connection with the Incash platform or the Products and Services. The said Intellectual Property Righ